put('N163','Exclude','EC1','https://research.chalmers.se/en/publication/553539','Full abstract','The university author record evaluates explanation coherence/physics grounding to intercept wrong optical-network decisions and preserve automation.','The full abstract concerns decision verification and physical coherence, without a separate repeated/perturbed SHAP/LIME explanation-stability outcome.','Complete institutional abstract opened and inspected; full paper not read.')
put('N178','Exclude','EC1','https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/11727032','Full abstract','The complete cached publisher abstract uses SHAP contributions/interactions and bootstrapping for spatial biomass-prediction reliability.','Bootstrap uncertainty is about biomass predictions, not uncertainty/stability of SHAP explanations.','Full cached publisher abstract read through search result page content; direct IEEE opening failed with418. No complete paper read.')
put('N195','Exclude','EC3','https://research.lancaster-university.uk/en/publications/ano2rule-rule-based-global-interpretation-for-unsupervised-anomal/','Full abstract','The author-university abstract defines an Interior Clustering Tree and Compositional Boundary Exploration for a global rule surrogate.','The studied explainer is a rule-based method outside SHAP/LIME, even though fidelity/robustness are evaluated.','Full institutional abstract opened; metadata confirms DOI. No claim of full-paper verification.')
