put('N680','Exclude','EC1','https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s42107-025-01527-0','Full abstract','The publisher abstract compares concrete-strength models, Bayesian predictive uncertainty and SHAP/permutation feature importance.','No attribution-stability analysis is separately reported; uncertainty belongs to strength predictions.','Full publisher abstract opened. Full article requires subscription; secondary retraction-like flags were not treated as verified publisher status.')
