meta('U410','https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compag.2026.112294','Exact title/DOI found in secondary journal metadata and an author-associated institutional publication profile.','Primary DOI route unavailable; no complete primary abstract read. Include for retrieval.')
put('U415','Include','Potentially eligible','https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2590123026034195','Targeted full text','Cached publisher abstract/method sections report SHAP TreeExplainer on NSW crash tables and cross-model Spearman ranking correlations .874–.987.','Cross-model SHAP ranking stability is a separately stated question and measured outcome; retain for full-text scope assessment.','Complete cached primary abstract and relevant introduction/method sections inspected through search page content; live open returned403. Publisher issue says December2026, so confirm online-first date before applying the October search cutoff.')
meta('U430','https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S001623612501659X','Matching publisher title/DOI and partial cached abstract describe TPOT/RFR, SHAP and Monte Carlo coal-gasification optimization.','Publisher opening returned403 and complete abstract was not obtained. Partial content suggests predictive optimization, but Include for full-text assessment rather than infer absent explanation-stability results.')
